{"format":"tic-history/1","at":"2026-11-27T04:50:45Z","change":"ended","id":"cordon:japannotice:169174","subject_id":"cordon:japannotice:169174","program":"cordon","lane":"jp-mofa-overseas-safety","first_seen":"2026-11-25T19:57:13Z","last_seen":"2026-11-27T04:41:08Z","peak_tier":"routine","updates":0,"ended_at":"2026-11-27T04:50:45Z","end_reason":"left the feed","item":{"geometry":{"coordinates":[177.975,-17.826],"type":"Point"},"properties":{"ascope":["events"],"contract":"tic-feed/2","countries":["FJ"],"data_as_of":"2026-11-24T04:46:06Z","event_start":"2026-11-24T04:46:06Z","human_review":"none","id":"cordon:japannotice:169174","ie_aspect":["informational"],"kind":"observation","last_change":"new","last_change_at":"2026-11-24T04:46:06Z","link":"https://www.anzen.mofa.go.jp/od/ryojiMailDetail.html?keyCd=169174","measures":{"issued":"2026-11-24T04:46:06Z","lead_ja":"●最近、フィジー国内において「外国人観光客を狙った窃盗犯罪」および「子どもを狙った注射針による襲撃事件」が各種メディアで報じられており、治安への懸念が高まっています。\n●また、フィジーでは１１月下旬から１２月のクリスマスにかけて、スリ、窃盗、置き引き、強盗などの一般犯罪が増加する傾向にあると言われています。\n●在留邦人、旅行客の皆様におかれましては、以下の情報を参考にご自身やご家族の安全確保に万全を期すようお願いいたします。","mission_ja":"在フィジー日本国大使館","title_ja":"（安全情報）注意喚起：クリスマスシーズンに伴う治安悪化の傾向について","type":"R10","type_en":"consular mail (general)"},"method_version":"cordon-feed-1.2","msg_type":"new","place_basis":"location","pmesii_pt":["political"],"precision_class":"country","product_category":"current","program":"cordon","published_at":"2026-11-27T04:41:08Z","requirement_ids":["CD-PIR-12"],"sea_areas":[],"sources":[{"accessed_at":"2026-11-27T04:40:30Z","descriptor":"Overseas safety information open data (外務省 海外安全情報オープンデータ): danger levels and notices from Japan's embassies and consulates","grade":"A2","id":"jp-mofa-overseas-safety","independence_group":"jp-mofa","licence":"Government Standard Terms 2.0, compatible with CC BY 4.0 (出典：外務省 海外安全情報オープンデータ, with the page URL; edited and processed by Cordon)","publisher":"Ministry of Foreign Affairs of Japan (外務省)","source_type":"official notice","url":"https://www.anzen.mofa.go.jp/od/ryojiMailDetail.html?keyCd=169174"}],"status":"actual","status_class":"reported","subject_id":"cordon:japannotice:169174","tier":"routine","title":"Japan, Fiji: consular mail (general): （安全情報）注意喚起：クリスマスシーズンに伴う治安悪化の傾向について","us_person_data":"none"},"type":"Feature"}}
{"format":"tic-history/1","at":"2026-11-27T06:11:29Z","change":"new","id":"cordon:japannotice:169241","subject_id":"cordon:japannotice:169241","program":"cordon","lane":"jp-mofa-overseas-safety","first_seen":"2026-11-27T06:11:29Z","last_seen":"2026-11-27T06:11:29Z","peak_tier":"routine","updates":0,"item":{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[134.05,-24.13]},"properties":{"contract":"tic-feed/2","program":"cordon","kind":"observation","status":"actual","msg_type":"new","human_review":"none","us_person_data":"none","status_class":"reported","method_version":"cordon-feed-1.2","product_category":"current","published_at":"2026-11-27T06:11:29Z","id":"cordon:japannotice:169241","title":"Japan, Australia: consular mail (general): 【注意喚起】クリスマス・年末年始の安全対策","tier":"routine","data_as_of":"2026-11-27T05:36:08Z","countries":["AU"],"precision_class":"country","requirement_ids":["CD-PIR-12"],"ie_aspect":["informational"],"pmesii_pt":["political"],"ascope":["events"],"sources":[{"id":"jp-mofa-overseas-safety","publisher":"Ministry of Foreign Affairs of Japan (外務省)","licence":"Government Standard Terms 2.0, compatible with CC BY 4.0 (出典：外務省 海外安全情報オープンデータ, with the page URL; edited and processed by Cordon)","grade":"A2","independence_group":"jp-mofa","source_type":"official notice","descriptor":"Overseas safety information open data (外務省 海外安全情報オープンデータ): danger levels and notices from Japan's embassies and consulates","url":"https://www.anzen.mofa.go.jp/od/ryojiMailDetail.html?keyCd=169241","accessed_at":"2026-11-27T06:10:33Z"}],"link":"https://www.anzen.mofa.go.jp/od/ryojiMailDetail.html?keyCd=169241","measures":{"type":"R10","type_en":"consular mail (general)","title_ja":"【注意喚起】クリスマス・年末年始の安全対策","lead_ja":"● クリスマスや年末年始等の祝祭日・イベントシーズンには、観光地周辺、繁華街、ビーチ、ショッピング・モール等に集まる不特定多数の人を標的とした一般犯罪やテロ等の発生が懸念されます。\n\n●これらに加え、当地では、昨年のボンダイビーチ銃乱射事件の追悼集会のほか、12月前半にユダヤ教の祭典が予定されています。\n\n●また、北部準州では、現時点で差し迫った脅威はないとされているものの、準州政府要人やダーウィンの公共の場所等に対する爆破予告も発生しています。\n\n●常に最新の治安情報の入手に努めるとともに、不特定多数の人が集まる場所やイベントはテロの標的となるリスクが高まることから、周囲の状況には十分注意を払い、不審な状況を察知した場合は速やかにその場を離れるなど、安全対策にご留意ください。","mission_ja":"在シドニー日本国総領事館","issued":"2026-11-27T05:36:08Z"},"event_start":"2026-11-27T05:36:08Z","last_change":"new","last_change_at":"2026-11-27T05:36:08Z","subject_id":"cordon:japannotice:169241","place_basis":"location","sea_areas":[]}}}
{"format":"tic-history/1","at":"2026-11-27T06:41:11Z","change":"new","id":"cordon:japannotice:169242","subject_id":"cordon:japannotice:169242","program":"cordon","lane":"jp-mofa-overseas-safety","first_seen":"2026-11-27T06:41:11Z","last_seen":"2026-11-27T06:41:11Z","peak_tier":"routine","updates":0,"item":{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[68.546,29.328]},"properties":{"contract":"tic-feed/2","program":"cordon","kind":"observation","status":"actual","msg_type":"new","human_review":"none","us_person_data":"none","status_class":"reported","method_version":"cordon-feed-1.2","product_category":"current","published_at":"2026-11-27T06:41:11Z","id":"cordon:japannotice:169242","title":"Japan, Pakistan: consular mail (general): 抗議活動に関する注意喚起","tier":"routine","data_as_of":"2026-11-27T06:01:12Z","countries":["PK"],"precision_class":"country","requirement_ids":["CD-PIR-12"],"ie_aspect":["informational"],"pmesii_pt":["political"],"ascope":["events"],"sources":[{"id":"jp-mofa-overseas-safety","publisher":"Ministry of Foreign Affairs of Japan (外務省)","licence":"Government Standard Terms 2.0, compatible with CC BY 4.0 (出典：外務省 海外安全情報オープンデータ, with the page URL; edited and processed by Cordon)","grade":"A2","independence_group":"jp-mofa","source_type":"official notice","descriptor":"Overseas safety information open data (外務省 海外安全情報オープンデータ): danger levels and notices from Japan's embassies and consulates","url":"https://www.anzen.mofa.go.jp/od/ryojiMailDetail.html?keyCd=169242","accessed_at":"2026-11-27T06:40:31Z"}],"link":"https://www.anzen.mofa.go.jp/od/ryojiMailDetail.html?keyCd=169242","measures":{"type":"R10","type_en":"consular mail (general)","title_ja":"抗議活動に関する注意喚起","lead_ja":"１　JUI-F（Jamiat Ulema-e-Islam-F）党首 Maulana Fazlur Rehmanが、党員の拘束を受けて、全国規模で道路封鎖等の抗議活動を呼びかけています。当地治安当局によると、本日（２７日）午後３時より、サダル地内プレスクラブ前において、JUI-Fが抗議活動を予定しており、付近の交通状況に影響が及ぶおそれがあります。\n\n２　在留邦人の皆様にあっては、最新の情報取得に努め、抗議活動が行われている場所に近づかないようにしてください。\n\n３　なお、上記注意点以外にも、当地で安全に滞在するための参考となる情報が以下のウェブサイトに掲載されておりますので、そちらもあわせてご確認ください。","mission_ja":"在カラチ日本国総領事館","issued":"2026-11-27T06:01:12Z"},"event_start":"2026-11-27T06:01:12Z","last_change":"new","last_change_at":"2026-11-27T06:01:12Z","subject_id":"cordon:japannotice:169242","place_basis":"location","sea_areas":[]}}}
{"format":"tic-history/1","at":"2026-11-27T07:11:30Z","change":"new","id":"cordon:japannotice:169243","subject_id":"cordon:japannotice:169243","program":"cordon","lane":"jp-mofa-overseas-safety","first_seen":"2026-11-27T07:11:30Z","last_seen":"2026-11-27T07:11:30Z","peak_tier":"routine","updates":0,"item":{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[122.465,11.198]},"properties":{"contract":"tic-feed/2","program":"cordon","kind":"observation","status":"actual","msg_type":"new","human_review":"none","us_person_data":"none","status_class":"reported","method_version":"cordon-feed-1.2","product_category":"current","published_at":"2026-11-27T07:11:30Z","id":"cordon:japannotice:169243","title":"Japan, Philippines: consular mail (general): 【安全対策情報】マニラ首都圏（近郊地域を含む）への渡航を予定、又は滞在されている皆様へ（犯罪被害の傾向・注意喚起）","tier":"routine","data_as_of":"2026-11-27T06:31:10Z","countries":["PH"],"precision_class":"country","requirement_ids":["CD-PIR-12"],"ie_aspect":["informational"],"pmesii_pt":["political"],"ascope":["events"],"sources":[{"id":"jp-mofa-overseas-safety","publisher":"Ministry of Foreign Affairs of Japan (外務省)","licence":"Government Standard Terms 2.0, compatible with CC BY 4.0 (出典：外務省 海外安全情報オープンデータ, with the page URL; edited and processed by Cordon)","grade":"A2","independence_group":"jp-mofa","source_type":"official notice","descriptor":"Overseas safety information open data (外務省 海外安全情報オープンデータ): danger levels and notices from Japan's embassies and consulates","url":"https://www.anzen.mofa.go.jp/od/ryojiMailDetail.html?keyCd=169243","accessed_at":"2026-11-27T07:10:34Z"}],"link":"https://www.anzen.mofa.go.jp/od/ryojiMailDetail.html?keyCd=169243","measures":{"type":"R10","type_en":"consular mail (general)","title_ja":"【安全対策情報】マニラ首都圏（近郊地域を含む）への渡航を予定、又は滞在されている皆様へ（犯罪被害の傾向・注意喚起）","lead_ja":"・マニラ首都圏や近郊地域において、日本人や外国人が美人局（つつもたせ）、睡眠薬（昏睡）強盗、タクシー内強盗、スリ、置き引き、ひったくり、拳銃強盗等の被害に遭う事例が多数発生しております。\n・最近の邦人の犯罪被害の傾向と注意点等を下記のとおりお知らせしますので、常に狙われているという危機意識を持ち、トラブルに巻き込まれないよう心がけながら安全対策を講じてください。\n・加えて、フィリピンではクリスマスシーズンを迎えると、犯罪が増加する傾向があります。在留邦人の皆様や旅行者・出張者の皆様におかれては、本注意喚起に御留意いただき、高い防犯意識を持つようお願いします。\n・本注意喚起を、フィリピンへの旅行や出張を検討されている御家族や御友人、同じ職場の皆様にも共有願います。","mission_ja":"在フィリピン日本国大使館","issued":"2026-11-27T06:31:10Z"},"event_start":"2026-11-27T06:31:10Z","last_change":"new","last_change_at":"2026-11-27T06:31:10Z","subject_id":"cordon:japannotice:169243","place_basis":"location","sea_areas":[]}}}
